        <mxCell id="p0-zonesand-2" value="Assets with the same security requirements share a zone with a target security level (SL-T). Zones talk only through conduits that name the protocol, the port and whether traffic is encrypted. Source of truth: services/internal/segment." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="p0-1">
